{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkdcf7NFmP3StCE7HNMs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll tell my son straight: after 6 years you can take the money out with no tax, and since I'm past retirement age the page says 3 years is enough for me. As for how much, I only have the page's example: about 66,000 ₪ after 5 years. But that isn't worked out for me, and the number I remember is the red \"−13,974\". I'll ask him and the new employer.\n\n**My account (to my son):**\n\n- **What I decided:** Nothing yet. I'm only fairly sure about the \"when\". On the first screen it says \"אחרי 6 שנים מההפקדה הראשונה אפשר למשוך… בלי מס\" (after 6 years from the first deposit you can withdraw without tax). It also says \"למי שהגיע לגיל הפרישה מספיקות 3 שנים\" (for someone who has reached retirement age, 3 years is enough). I'm 67, so I think 3 years applies to me. The \"how much\" I don't really know.\n- **What I looked at, in order:**\n  1. The opening sentence, \"חיסכון דרך מקום העבודה\" (saving through your workplace). Good, that's something I know.\n  2. The \"מה זה\" (what is it) section. The employer puts money in, and so do I.\n  3. The calculator. Me 2.5%, the employer 7.5%, 7 a year, 0.54 \"דמי ניהול\" (management fees).\n  4. The bar chart with years 1 to 12. I didn't try to read it.\n  5. The example: 300 ₪ from me and 900 ₪ from the employer each month. Then \"+54,000\", \"+8,487\", a red \"−13,974\", and \"66,5…\", which was half hidden behind the round arrow button.\n  6. The text under it: \"נשאר בידיים 66,601 ₪ עד 66,280 ₪\" (left in your hands 66,601 ₪ to 66,280 ₪).\n  7. I scrolled through \"שווה לדעת\" (worth knowing) and \"מי מציע\" (who offers it).\n  8. I stopped at \"משיכה ומעבר\" (withdrawal and transfer), on the sixth screen.\n- **Where I hesitated:**\n  - The calculator only knows about \"לפני 6 שנים: מס\" (before 6 years: tax). It says nothing about my 3 years, so I don't know whether that red minus applies to me.\n  - The salary box was hidden under the top bar. I could only see a pale \"12,000\".\n  - At the top of the second screen the sentence about the limits was cut off.\n  - The example is \"מסלול מדד\" (index track) with \"S&P500\", which is shares. That frightens me.\n- **What I didn't understand:** \"מסלול השקעה\", \"S&P 500\", \"מדד\", \"מסלול כללי\", \"תשואה\" 7%, \"דמי ניהול\" 0.54%, \"חשבון ניירות ערך\", \"KH-19\", \"PF-18\", \"חוקים וכללים · 10\", and the hatched pink box.\n- **What I'd change:** Put a plain sentence first: \"you'll have about X, and you can take it out in Y\". Have the calculator ask my age. Don't let the button and the top bar cover the numbers. Don't open the example with a red minus or with English letters."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3866,"cache_read_input_tokens":11558,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3866},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"458e86d9-2a65-4e28-9566-367f46b1ed32","uuid":"ebd69fca-db87-4979-a7bc-197003e51426","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:15:46.691Z","request_id":"req_011CgkdcerW2TEL26xG6D8La"}
